{"title":"Pomegranate tree ","startsAt":"2026-10-31T20:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T21:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Set between Toronto and Tehran, DERAKHT-E ANAAR (The Pomegranate Tree) is a moving story of family, memory, exile, forgiveness, and hope. Through unforgettable characters, the play explores the choices that divide us, the roots that connect us, and the humanity that still has the power to bring us home.\n\nFollow our journey from first rehearsal to opening night.\n\n🍎 One-night performance\n📍 Richmond Hill Centre for the Performing Arts\n📅 Saturday, October 31, 2026","venue":{"name":"Richmond hill theatre for performing art","address":"10268 Yonge st,, Richmond hill","lat":43.877415,"lng":-79.439156,"city":"Richmond hill"},"fee":null,"group":"AuraVista Movement","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/5/c/2/highres_535710146.jpeg"}